'''Bluesteel''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 1]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
Its blade is made out of the metallic bluesteel texture, hence the name. The guard is blue, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*It derives from Roblox’s popular [https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Bluesteel_(series) Bluesteel Series].
*It has a [[Bluesteel (Gun)|partner gun]] and [[Bluesteel (Radio)|radio]] under the same name. 

